usage: runsieve [-h] {capture,minimize,replay,verify-minimal,export} ...

Capture and reduce a failed agent run into an offline reproduction.

positional arguments:
  {capture,minimize,replay,verify-minimal,export}
    capture             capture one OpenAI Agents SDK trace
    minimize            reduce a capsule with a predicate
    replay              materialize recorded outputs without executing
                        application code
    verify-minimal      independently verify 1-minimality
    export              write a one-command issue reproduction

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
